for all positive reals $x$ and positive integers $n$. (A function $f$ is nondecreasing if $f(x) \le f(y)$ whenever $x \le y$.)

mx.1994.2.6.reviewed_statement:
Let $C$ be a $10 \times 10$ grid. Consider pieces of the shapes (a), (b), (c) shown below, where each square of the pieces is $1 \times 1$.

